<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><documents xmlns:xsi = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation = "HDocumentSchema.xsd"><document type = "H"><pnldref>H19112</pnldref><english><title>Provide the Charity Commission with false or misleading information</title><additionalkeywords><additionalkeyword>charity</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>commission</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>know</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>knowingly</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>reckless</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>recklessly</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>provide</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>furnish</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>submit</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>information</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>details</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>false</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>misleading</additionalkeyword></additionalkeywords><standardoffencewording>On **(..SPECIFY DATE..) at **(..SPECIFY TOWNSHIP..) **(..SPECIFY DETAILS OF THE OFFENCE..)</standardoffencewording><legislation>Contrary to section 60(1) and (3) of the Charities Act 2011.</legislation><pointstoprove>date and location&lt;br /&gt;knowingly or recklessly&lt;br /&gt; provide the Charity Commission &lt;br /&gt;with information&lt;br /&gt; which is false or misleading in a material particular</pointstoprove><investigatoractions><investigatoraction><code>IA1</code><description>Fingerprint and photograph</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA2</code><description>DNA Samples: If crime scene stain present - take evidential sample If no crime scene stain and DNA not confirmed on PNC - take Criminal Justice sample. If DNA confirmed on PNC - CJ sample not required</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA27</code><description>Confirm proposed charge is appropriately authorised (Police or CPS)</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA28</code><des